==Trivia==
*Macaroni Town is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Spaghetti Western|Spaghetti Western]] subgenre of Western films, also known as Macaroni Western.
*This is the first stage to feature a buffed [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy on {{1c}} difficulty.

